    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip the board. Match the cats. Outsmart the puzzle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Mirror Match</i>, a group of quirky cats move in sync across mirrored sides of the board. Your goal? Match each furry friend with its partner\u2014but every move reflects on both sides. Cute? Definitely. Easy? Not quite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3b 50 handcrafted levels of mirror logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Dozens of charming, animated cat characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude9e Unique mirrored movement puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Bright, colorful cartoon art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Relaxing soundtrack and purr-fect sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Easy to play, hard to put down</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a cat lover, puzzle master, or cozy gamer\u2014<i>Mirror Match</i> delivers a delightful brain-teasing experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip the board. Match the cats. Outsmart the puzzle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Mirror Match</i>, a group of quirky cats move in sync across mirrored sides of the board. Your goal? Match each furry friend with its partner\u2014but every move reflects on both sides. Cute? Definitely. Easy? Not quite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3b 50 handcrafted levels of mirror logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Dozens of charming, animated cat characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude9e Unique mirrored movement puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Bright, colorful cartoon art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Relaxing soundtrack and purr-fect sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Easy to play, hard to put down</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a cat lover, puzzle master, or cozy gamer\u2014<i>Mirror Match</i> delivers a delightful brain-teasing experience.</p>",
